    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37392" root="كيد" body-key="k">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اكتاد</span></b>  is of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افْتَعَلَ</span> from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الكَيْدُ</span>;
(K;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اكتادهُ</span> signifies <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إحْتَالَهُ</span> [or rather
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِحْتَالَ عَلَيْهِ</span>]. (TK.) See 1.

